{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yc2dw4PuLC1792685859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>超強颱風薔琵迫近日本沖繩，逾200班航班取消，近兩萬旅客受影響。</p><p></p><p>受薔琵影響，沖繩石垣島周三風勢頗大，有酒店提前做好防風措施，落下擋風窗簾。</p><p></p><p>日本氣象廳錄得薔琵，中心附近最大風速約每小時二百公里，風力足以吹倒部分房屋，強風導致數以百計航班取消，連接沖繩本島和周邊離島的過百條渡輪航線停航。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cj6t6rdI7m1792685889.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當局指九州、日本西部等地區或會出現強降雨，影響預計持續到周末，氣象廳提醒周末計劃前往相關地區的民眾，留意暴雨、水浸和山泥傾瀉等風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:39:43.150351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.518271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:38:07.384430+00:00","content_hash":"981c9991efc0f5f5807941d23a5784513f5fb441323992c45367aa11e90cfe70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:39:43.150351+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}